                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Rockhill.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-03-22"><hi rendition="#italic">March 22,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay states, in regard to Articles VIII and IX of the joint note, that we as
                    signatories should, through our military representatives, join in determining
                    the measures as to which the right to subsequently participate has been reserved
                    by the United States.)</p>
            </div>
